MAIN
MOVE TEMP 19 4
MOVE TEMP 20 HALLOCATE TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 4
MOVE TEMP 22 HALLOCATE TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 MultiArgs_ved_TestMultiArgs
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 24
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 25 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 25
PRINT TEMP 4
END
MultiArgs_ved_TestMultiArgs [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 26 4
MOVE TEMP 27 HALLOCATE TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 28 8
MOVE TEMP 29 HALLOCATE TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 30 TEMP 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 31 Calculator_ved_AddThree
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 32 Calculator_ved_AddFour
HSTORE TEMP 4 4 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 33 10
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 34 20
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 34
MOVE TEMP 35 30
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 35
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 8 0
MOVE TEMP 36 CALL TEMP 9 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 5 TEMP 6 TEMP 7 )
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 10
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 37 5
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 37
MOVE TEMP 38 10
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 38
MOVE TEMP 39 15
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 39
MOVE TEMP 40 20
MOVE TEMP 14 TEMP 40
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 16 TEMP 15 4
MOVE TEMP 41 CALL TEMP 16 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 11 TEMP 12 TEMP 13 TEMP 14 )
MOVE TEMP 17 TEMP 41
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 17
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 42 0
MOVE TEMP 18 TEMP 42

RETURN TEMP 18
END
Calculator_ved_AddThree [ 4 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 43 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 43
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 5
MOVE TEMP 44 PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 44
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 6

RETURN TEMP 4
END
Calculator_ved_AddFour [ 5 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 45 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 45
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 6
MOVE TEMP 46 PLUS TEMP 5 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 46
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 7
MOVE TEMP 47 PLUS TEMP 5 TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 47
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 8

RETURN TEMP 5
